msgstr "Vyberte interpolačný algoritmus"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/vr360_and_3d/vr360_equi_mask.rst:60
msgid "Vertical Start / End"
msgstr "Vertikálny Začiatok / Koniec"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/vr360_and_3d/vr360_equi_mask.rst:61
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/vr360_and_3d/vr360_equi_mask.rst:64
msgid "Degree"
msgstr "Stupeň"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/vr360_and_3d/vr360_equi_mask.rst:62
msgid ""
"Define the vertical FOV (field of vision). **Start** defines the width in "
"degrees of the un-matted area; **End** is the width in degrees where the "
"matte is 100%."
msgstr ""
"Definuje vertikálne zorné pole (FOV). **Začiatok** definuje šírku v stupňoch "
"nezamaskovanej oblasti; **Koniec** je šírka v stupňoch, kde je maska 100 %."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/vr360_and_3d/vr360_equi_mask.rst:63
msgid "Horizontal Start / End"
msgstr "Horizontálny Začiatok / Koniec"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/vr360_and_3d/vr360_equi_mask.rst:65
msgid ""
"Define the horizontal FOV. **Start** is half the height in degrees of the un-"
"matted area; **End** is half the height in degrees where the matte is 100%."
msgstr ""
"Definuje horizontálne zorné pole (FOV). **Začiatok** je polovica výšky v "
"stupňoch nezamaskovanej oblasti; **Koniec** je polovica výšky v stupňoch, "
"kde je maska 100 %."

